 "journal/2008/2008-01-28.md:25": "#2016-02-06?h=Brenan%E2%80%99s%20vision%20in%20fact%20has%20more%20in%20common%20with%20Lucius%E2%80%99%20than%20does%20that%20of%20Cleaver%3B%20particularly%20interesting%20is%20the%20suddenness%20of%20his%20%E2%80%9Csense%20of%20some%20enormous%20force%20and%20beauty%20existing%20around%20me%E2%80%9D%2C%20which%20closely%20parallels%20Lucius%E2%80%99%20instant%20conviction%20that%20what%20he%20sees%20is%20a%20manifestation%20of%20the%20goddess%20whose%20power%20controls%20the%20workings%20of%20the%20whole%20universe%20%2811.1%29.%20Even%20more%20interesting%2C%20perhaps%2C%20is%20the%20contrast%20between%20Lucius%E2%80%99%20voluntary%20submission%20to%20the%20dominion%20of%20the%20goddess%20and%20Brenan%E2%80%99s%20stalwart%20refusal%20to%20abdicate%20his%20selfhood.",
 "journal/2015/2015-07-20.md:23": "#bookshelf/Williams%2C%20Charles/The%20Figure%20of%20Beatrice/2.%20Beatrice?h=She%20cut%20Dante%20in%20the%20street.%20%E2%80%9CShe%20refused%20me%20her%20most%20sweet%20greeting%20in%20which%20all%20my%20blessedness%20lay.%E2%80%9D%20He%20explains%20what%20he%20means%20by%20blessedness%2C%20and%20it%20seems%20that%20he%20meant%20blessedness.%20He%20writes%3A%20%E2%80%9CDico%20%E2%80%94%20I%20tell%20you%20when%20she%20appeared%20from%20any%20direction%2C%20the%20hope%20of%20her%20admirable%20greeting%20abolished%20in%20me%20all%20enmity%2C%20and%20I%20was%20possessed%20by%20a%20flame%20of%20charity%20which%20compelled%20me%20to%20forgive%20anyone%20who%20had%20done%20me%20an%20offence%3B%20and%20if%20anyone%20had%20asked%20me%20a%20question%20about%20anything%2C%20I%20should%20have%20said%20only%20Love!%20with%20a%20countenance%20full%20of%20humility.%E2%80%9D%20The%20sight%20of%20Beatrice%20%28dico%20%E2%80%94%20I%20tell%20you%29%20filled%20him%20with%20the%20fire%20of%20charity%20and%20clothed%20him%20with%20humility%3B%20he%20became%20%E2%80%94%20and%20for%20a%20moment%20he%20knew%20it%20%E2%80%94%20an%20entire%20goodwill.%20Neither%20of%20these%20great%20virtues%20is%20gained%20by%20considering%20oneself%3B%20and%20the%20apparition%20of%20this%20glory%2C%20living%20and%20moving%20in%20Florence%2C%20precisely%20frees%20him%20from%20the%20consideration%20of%20himself.%20Love%20is%20greater%20than%20he%3A%20his%20soul%20was%20right%20when%20it%20exclaimed%3A%20%E2%80%9CA%20stronger%20than%20I%20dominates%20me%E2%80%9D%20and%20trembled%2C%20and%20his%20brain%20was%20right%20when%20it%20said%3A%20%E2%80%9CBehold%20your%20blessedness%E2%80%9D%2C%20and%20even%20his%20flesh%20when%20it%20said%3A%20%E2%80%9CO%20misery%2C%20how%20I%20shall%20be%20shaken%E2%80%9D%2C%20as%20in%20Malory%20%E2%80%9Cthe%20deadly%20flesh%20began%20to%20tremble%20right%20hard%20when%20it%20beheld%20spiritual%20things%E2%80%9D.%20This%20love%20certainly%20does%20not%20exclude%20the%20physical%20reactions%3B%20his%20body%2C%20he%20says%2C%20was%20so%20oppressed%20by%20it%2C%20as%20by%20a%20surfeit%20of%20sweetness%2C%20that%20it%20felt%20heavy%20and%20lifeless%3B%20her%20greeting%20was%20too%20much%20for%20him%3B%20it%20%E2%80%9Cpassava%20e%20redundava%20la%20mia%20capacitade%20%E2%80%93%20overpassed%20and%20overflowed%20my%20capacity%E2%80%9D.%20This%20too%20is%20not%20without%20significance%20when%20we%20consider%20the%20way%20in%20which%2C%20in%20the%20Paradiso%2C%20the%20body%20is%20spoken%20of%2C%20%E2%80%9Cthe%20glorious%20and%20holy%20flesh%E2%80%9D%20%28Par.%20XIV%2C%2043%29%3B%20there%20the%20light%2C%20beauty%2C%20and%20love%20of%20the%20holy%20souls%20will%20grow%20greater%20through%20their%20bodies%2C%20and%20they%20will%20see%20more%20deeply%20into%20God.%20It%20is%20an%20image%20of%20this%20state%20which%20he%20already%20sees%20in%20Beatrice%2C%20as%20for%20a%20moment%20its%20actuality%20%E2%80%93%20humility%20and%20charity%20%E2%80%93%20is%2C%20so%20far%20as%20he%20can%20bear%20it%2C%20communicated%20to%20his%20soul.%20On%20this%20particular%20occasion%20she%20passes%20and%20ignores%20him.%20That%20sudden%20snub%2C%20those%20cold%20averted%20eyes%2C%20must%20have%20struck%20similarly%20%E2%80%93%20for%20better%20or%20worse%20reasons%20%E2%80%93%20on%20numbers%20of%20young%20men.%20Dante%20was%20young%3B%20he%20was%20medieval%20and%20an%20Italian%3B%20he%20went%20away%20and%20cried.%20It%20did%20not%20occur%20to%20him%20to%20be%20ashamed%20of%20his%20emotions%3B%20he%20wept%20and%20slept%20%E2%80%93%20%E2%80%9Ccome%20un%20pargoletto%20battuto%20lagrimando%20%E2%80%93%20like%20a%20beaten%20sobbing%20little%20child%E2%80%9D%2C%20and%20he%20had%20a%20dream%20of%20Love.%20The%20image%20of%20Love%20appeared%20to%20him%20in%20sleep%20on%20a%20number%20of%20occasions%3B%20or%20%28perhaps%20more%20truly%29%20he%20invented%20these%20dreams%20in%20order%20to%20declare%20something%20of%20the%20nature%20of%20this%20quality%20of%20Love.%20It%20is%20not%20possible%20to%20go%20over%20all%2C%20but%20this%20one%20is%20of%20importance.%20Love%20appears%20to%20him%20clothed%20in%20white%20and%20sitting%20deep%20in%20thought%3B%20presently%20he%20gazes%20at%20Dante%20and%20after%20a%20time%20says%20with%20a%20sigh%3A%20%E2%80%9CSon%2C%20it%20is%20time%20to%20put%20aside%20our%20pretences%20%E2%80%93%20simulacra%20%E2%80%9D%2C%20and%20he%20himself%20begins%20to%20weep.%20%E2%80%9CI%20said%2C%20%E2%80%98Lord%20of%20nobility%2C%20why%20do%20you%20weep%3F%E2%80%99%20He%20said%3A%20%E2%80%98Ego%20tanquam%20centrum%20circuli%2C%20cui%20simili%20modo%20se%20habent%20circumferentiae%20partes%3B%20tu%20autem%20non%20sic.%E2%80%99%20Thinking%20over%20these%20words%2C%20it%20seemed%20to%20me%20he%20had%20spoken%20obscurely%2C%20and%20I%20forced%20myself%20to%20speak%20and%20say%20to%20him%3A%20%E2%80%98Lord%2C%20why%20do%20you%20speak%20to%20me%20so%20darkly%3F%E2%80%99%20And%20he%20answered%20me%20in%20the%20common%20tongue%3A%20%E2%80%98Do%20not%20ask%20more%20than%20is%20useful%20to%20you.%E2%80%99%20%E2%80%9D%20After%20which%20they%20go%20on%20to%20the%20matter%20of%20the%20snub%2C%20and%20Love%20causes%20Dante%20to%20write%20a%20poem%20to%20put%20himself%20right%20with%20%E2%80%9Cour%20Beatrice%E2%80%9D.%20But%20while%20Love%20was%20talking%20the%20more%20ceremonial%20Latin%2C%20what%20did%20he%20mean%3F%20%E2%80%9CI%20am%20the%20centre%20of%20a%20circle%20to%20which%20all%20parts%20of%20the%20circumference%20are%20in%20a%20similar%20relation%3B%20but%20you%20are%20not%20so.%E2%80%9D%20The%20whole%20crisis%20is%20about%20Dante%E2%80%99s%20unhappiness%20at%20Beatrice%E2%80%99s%20behaviour%3B%20this%20saying%20then%20has%20some%20bearing%20on%20it.%20Dante%20is%20not%20like%20Love%3B%20he%20is%20not%20central%20to%20all%20the%20circumference.%20The%20earlier%20similitudes%20are%20to%20be%20put%20away%3B%20they%20are%20to%20speak%20truth%2C%20and%20the%20truth%20is%20that%20Dante%20is%20not%20Love.%20He%20moves%2C%20presumably%2C%20on%20the%20circumference%3B%20he%20changes%20and%20is%20changed%20with%20it%2C%20but%20Love%20is%20not.%20Greeting%20or%20no%20greeting%2C%20Love%20is%20Love.%20Love%20is%20not%20love%20Which%20alters%20when%20it%20alteration%20finds%20Or%20bends%20with%20the%20remover%20to%20remove.%20The%20preceding%20line%20and%20a%20half%20of%20the%20sonnet%20%E2%80%93%20Let%20me%20not%20to%20the%20marriage%20of%20true%20minds%20Admit%20impediments%20%E2%80%93%20are%20sometimes%20taken%20to%20refer%20to%20two%20lovers.%20But%20this%20makes%20nonsense%20of%20the%20next%20lines%2C%20for%20then%20one%20of%20the%20%E2%80%9Ctrue%20minds%E2%80%9D%20must%20%E2%80%9Calter%E2%80%9D%2C%20or%20the%20other%20could%20not%20find%20alteration.%20It%20is%20rather%20the%20union%20of%20two%20minds%20with%20Love%20that%20the%20sonnet%20refers%2C%20which%20%E2%80%9Cbears%20it%20out%20even%20to%20the%20edge%20of%20Doom%E2%80%9D%2C%20and%20the%20meaning%20is%20not%20unlike%20Dante%E2%80%99s%20dream.%20But%20Dante%2C%20for%20all%20that%20momentary%20charity%20and%20humility%2C%20is%20not%20yet%20in%20a%20state%20to%20recognize%20so%20much.%20There%20was%20written%20by%20St.%20Bonaventura%2C%20about%20the%20same%20time%2C%20a%20sentence%20which%2C%20with%20a%20like%20simile%2C%20had%20a%20further%20aim%3B%20it%20was%20the%20famous%20%E2%80%9CGod%20is%20a%20circle%20whose%20centre%20is%20everywhere%20and%20whose%20circumference%20nowhere.%E2%80%9D%20The%20two%20formulae%20together%20cover%20almost%20the%20whole%20of%20the%20Way%20of%20Images%20%E2%80%93%20and%20indeed%20of%20the%20Way%20of%20Rejection%20of%20Images%20also.%20Dante%20is%20not%20in%20the%20centre%3B%20he%20feels%20great%20emotions%20varyingly%3B%20only%20some%20parts%20of%20the%20circumference%20impose%20goodwill.%20But%20to%20Love%20in%20the%20centre%20all%20parts%20are%20equal%3B%20it%20does%20not%20matter%20whether%20the%20lover%20is%20successful%20or%20not%2C%20happy%20or%20not.%20To%20be%20so%20%E2%80%93%20%E2%80%9Cbut%20you%20are%20not%20so%E2%80%9D%20%E2%80%93%20one%20must%20will%20charity%20and%20humility%3B%20it%20is%20not%20enough%20that%20they%20shall%20be%20communicated%20by%20joy.%20Beyond%20this%20again%20lies%20that%20further%20state%20when%20Love%20is%20no%20longer%20in%20relation%20to%20something%20in%20the%20soul%20which%20is%20not%20Love%3B%20charity%20and%20humility%20do%20not%20exist%20there%20only%20in%20relation%20to%20some%20other%20particular%20image%3B%20they%20are%20at%20all%20times%20everywhere%20to%20everyone.%20So%20that%2C%20in%20this%20matter%20of%20the%20salutation%2C%20Dante%20knows%20the%20fullness%20of%20Love%20on%20occasion%20and%20by%20grace%3B%20but%20then%20he%20has%20to%20become%20it%2C%20without%20the%20means%20of%20that%20special%20illumination%20and%20particular%20initiative%3B%20and%20so%20becoming%2C%20all%20along%20the%20Way%20of%20the%20Images%2C%20he%20will%20find%20no%20separate%20knowledge%20of%20them%2C%20but%20in%20the%20end%20their%20absolute%20existence%2C%20as%20at%20the%20close%20of%20the%20Paradiso%2C%20where%20the%20Divine%20City%20exhibits%20them%20on%20all%20sides.",
 "journal/2016/2016-02-06.md:25": "#2008-01-28?h=Came%20back%20to%20the%20sitting%20room%20after%20TP%E2%80%94late%20on%2C%20after%20I%E2%80%99d%20enthused%20about%20New%20York%20and%20les%20lustres%2C%20and%20wondered%20about%20my%20suddenly-realized%20Canadian%20roots%2C%20and%20imagined%20Caia%20nodding%20approvingly%2C%20and%20wept%2C%20and%20wondered%20if%20I%E2%80%99d%20always%20weep%2C%20and%20heard%20TP%20equate%20my%20engagement%20with%20les%20lustres%20with%20my%20engagement%20and%20cheerfulness%20about%20Caia%2C%20and%20somehow%20a%20line%20about%20how%20I%20was%20continuing%20Caia%E2%80%99s%20development%20away%20from%20the%20sharp%20sarcastic%20response%20and%20somehow%20I%20closed%20my%20eyes%20and%20there%20was%20such%20a%20sea%20of%20light%20and%20joy%20and%20love%20buoying%20me%20up%20that%20I%20wondered%20how%20anyone%20could%20be%20lonely%20or%20sorrowful.%20A%20Beatrician%20vision.%20But%20all%20that%20love%20and%20light%20is%20there%20all%20the%20time%2C%20is%20or%20should%20be%20mine%20to%20command.%20Or%20serve.%20Or%20something.%20I%20have%20seen%20the%20vast%20and%20powerful%20engines%20as%20they%20truly%20are.%20Maybe%20the%20family%20love%2C%20maybe%20my%20keel%2C%20and%20they%20may%20be%20one%20and%20the%20same.%20And%20on%20the%20walk%20back%20to%20the%20subway%20I%20remembered%20Dad%20that%20December%20afternoon%20in%20%E2%80%9993%20saying%20that%20he%20was%20glad%20we%E2%80%99d%20reached%20that%20place%20together%2C%20and%20this%20evening%20I%20told%20him%20back%20that%20I%20was%20glad%20too.%20So%20this%20evening%20I%E2%80%99ve%20communed%20joyfully%20with%20both%20of%20my%20ghosts%E2%80%94is%20it%20any%20wonder%20that%20I%20feel%20like%20I%E2%80%99ve%20touched%20the%20face%20of%20God%2C%20or%20drunk%20deep%20from%20the%20well%20of%20Faith%20and%20Hope%20and%20Love%3F",
 "journal/2016/2016-02-07.md:47": "#bookshelf/Lewis%2C%20C.%20S/The%20Four%20Loves/Eros?h=And%20yet%20Eros%20is%20in%20a%20sense%20right%20to%20make%20this%20promise.%20The%20event%20of%20falling%20in%20love%20is%20of%20such%20a%20nature%20that%20we%20are%20right%20to%20reject%20as%20intolerable%20the%20idea%20that%20it%20should%20be%20transitory.%20In%20one%20high%20bound%20it%20has%20overleaped%20the%20massive%20wall%20of%20our%20selfhood%3B%20it%20has%20made%20appetite%20itself%20altruistic%2C%20tossed%20personal%20happiness%20aside%20as%20a%20triviality%20and%20planted%20the%20interests%20of%20another%20in%20the%20centre%20of%20our%20being.%20Spontaneously%20and%20without%20effort%20we%20have%20fulfilled%20the%20law%20%28towards%20one%20person%29%20by%20loving%20our%20neighbour%20as%20ourselves.%20It%20is%20an%20image%2C%20a%20foretaste%2C%20of%20what%20we%20must%20become%20to%20all%20if%20Love%20Himself%20rules%20in%20us%20without%20a%20rival.%20It%20is%20even%20%28well%20used%29%20a%20preparation%20for%20that.%20Simply%20to%20relapse%20from%20it%2C%20merely%20to%20%E2%80%9Cfall%20out%20of%E2%80%9D%20love%20again%2C%20is%20%E2%80%94%20if%20I%20may%20coin%20the%20ugly%20word%20%E2%80%94%20a%20sort%20of%20disredemption.%20Eros%20is%20driven%20to%20promise%20what%20Eros%20of%20himself%20cannot%20perform.%20Can%20we%20be%20in%20this%20selfless%20liberation%20for%20a%20lifetime%3F%20Hardly%20for%20a%20week.%20Between%20the%20best%20possible%20lovers%20this%20high%20condition%20is%20intermittent.%20The%20old%20self%20soon%20turns%20out%20to%20be%20not%20so%20dead%20as%20he%20pretended%20%E2%80%94%20as%20after%20a%20religious%20conversion.%20In%20either%20he%20may%20be%20momentarily%20knocked%20flat%3B%20he%20will%20soon%20be%20up%20again%3B%20if%20not%20on%20his%20feet%2C%20at%20least%20on%20his%20elbow%2C%20if%20not%20roaring%2C%20at%20least%20back%20to%20his%20surly%20grumbling%20or%20his%20mendicant%20whine.%20And%20Venus%20will%20often%20slip%20back%20into%20mere%20sexuality.%20But%20these%20lapses%20will%20not%20destroy%20a%20marriage%20between%20two%20%E2%80%9Cdecent%20and%20sensible%E2%80%9D%20people.%20The%20couple%20whose%20marriage%20will%20certainly%20be%20endangered%20by%20them%2C%20and%20possibly%20ruined%2C%20are%20those%20who%20have%20idolised%20Eros.%20They%20thought%20he%20had%20the%20power%20and%20truthfulness%20of%20a%20god.%20They%20expected%20that%20mere%20feeling%20would%20do%20for%20them%2C%20and%20permanently%2C%20all%20that%20was%20necessary.%20When%20this%20expectation%20is%20disappointed%20they%20throw%20the%20blame%20on%20Eros%20or%2C%20more%20usually%2C%20on%20their%20partners.%20In%20reality%2C%20however%2C%20Eros%2C%20having%20made%20his%20gigantic%20promise%20and%20shown%20you%20in%20glimpses%20what%20its%20performance%20would%20be%20like%2C%20has%20%E2%80%9Cdone%20his%20stuff%E2%80%9D.%20He%2C%20like%20a%20godparent%2C%20makes%20the%20vows%3B%20it%20is%20we%20who%20must%20keep%20them.%20It%20is%20we%20who%20must%20labour%20to%20bring%20our%20daily%20life%20into%20even%20closer%20accordance%20with%20what%20the%20glimpses%20have%20revealed.%20We%20must%20do%20the%20works%20of%20Eros%20when%20Eros%20is%20not%20present.%20This%20all%20good%20lovers%20know%2C%20though%20those%20who%20are%20not%20reflective%20or%20articulate%20will%20be%20able%20to%20express%20it%20only%20in%20a%20few%20conventional%20phrases%20about%20%E2%80%9Ctaking%20the%20rough%20along%20with%20the%20smooth%E2%80%9D%2C%20not%20%E2%80%9Cexpecting%20too%20much%E2%80%9D%2C%20having%20%E2%80%9Ca%20little%20common%20sense%E2%80%9D%2C%20and%20the%20like.%20And%20all%20good%20Christian%20lovers%20know%20that%20this%20programme%2C%20modest%20as%20it%20sounds%2C%20will%20not%20be%20carried%20out%20except%20by%20humility%2C%20charity%20and%20divine%20grace%3B%20that%20it%20is%20indeed%20the%20whole%20Christian%20life%20seen%20from%20one%20particular%20angle.",
